# hero.rec: rules every class shares. The classes themselves, and their numbers, are classes.rec.
# %rec: experience
#   exp               the experience each level needs, level 1 first, ten numbers per line; repeatable (51 in all)
# %rec: weapon_bonus (optional), melee damage by weapon type against a monster class:
#   weapon            sword, axe, bow, mace or staff; the first weapon listed that the hero holds is the one judged
#   versus            a monster class (enemies.rec's class: MC_UNDEAD, MC_ANIMAL, MC_DEMON)
#   percent           more (or, negative, less) damage, e.g. 50 or -50
#
